_entity.details                    
;THIS ENTRY CONTAINS THE COORDINATES OF WHEAT HSP 16.9 WHICH HAVE BEEN FITTED INTO THE CRYO-EM RECONSTRUCTION OF HSP 16.3 FROM M.TUBERCULOSIS. THE COMPND AND SOURCE RECORDS GIVE DETAILS OF THE PROTEIN REPRESENTED BY THE COORDINATES, RATHER THAN THE PROTEIN FROM WHICH THE EM MAP WAS DERIVED
;
